Subject: [PATCH] misc: add Allwinner V831 NPU driver

/dev/npu: power, clocks, resets, register-window mmap and contiguous buffers;
the NVDLA units are programmed from userspace.

---
 drivers/misc/Kconfig               |   1 +
 drivers/misc/Makefile              |   1 +
 drivers/misc/sun8i-npu/Kconfig     |  12 ++
 drivers/misc/sun8i-npu/Makefile    |   3 +
 drivers/misc/sun8i-npu/sun8i_npu.c | 328 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/uapi/linux/sun8i-npu.h     |  37 ++++
 6 files changed, 382 insertions(+)

